        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "The senator has likely had time to reflect on the president's speech.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Reflecting on the president's speech could be a good starting point for discussion.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      }
    ],
