  {
    "episode_id": 92293,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/2/92293.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 10,
    "turn_text": "Okay, since you you teed it up perfectly on infrastructure is a couple weeks ago, we talked quite a bit on this session about the infrastructure proposal. You know, as Farm Bureau, we're all about real infrastructure and, you know, roads, bridges, obviously include broadband in that. How are you finding these discussions shaping up, particularly within the Senate?",
