        "text": "The current moment represents a rare window for meaningful legislative action.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "Republican gains in Congress are expected to shift policy priorities significantly.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "Engagement now increases the chances of favorable long-term outcomes for Democratic interests.",
        "confidence": 0.84
      },
      {
        "text": "Leadership continuity and institutional memory among Democratic lawmakers inform strategic decision-making.",
        "confidence": 0.83
      }
    ],
    "turn_type_label": "Substantive",
    "conversation_move_label": "Assert / Elaborate"
  },
  {
