    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/2/92293.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 24,
    "turn_text": "Well, Senator, we appreciate your time today. I've always appreciated your voice of reason and common sense and your handle of the issues and your ability to connect the dots of what it means back to the farm gate in our communities. I just can't emphasize enough how much we appreciate you and your service to this state in our country.",
