    "turn_text": "folks, if you could see BJ, he's got his sneakers on when he talks about running back from the Capitol. He is literally doing his best to get the workout in and keep the energy. BJ, thank you. I haven't seen any questions come in specific to you. So Spencer, if you want to turn your camera on, you've been thinking a little bit about the president's joint address to Congress last night. And we've talked a little bit today about stepped up basis. Is there anything on your mind that you want to bring to the attention before we wrap up?",
